# ADR-042: Tactical Dynamic Active Directory Account Broker for Ephemeral Pipeline Workloads

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| **Status** | Proposed |
| **Date** | October 9, 2026 |
| **Target Audience** | IAM Engineering, Directory Services (AD) Team, Information Security / SOC, Enterprise Architecture |
| **Owners** | Platform Engineering |
