## 11. Operational SLOs

| SLO | Target (initial) |
| --- | --- |
| Reaper lag | Expired objects deleted within **30 minutes** of expiry (2× 15m schedule) |
| Quarantine population | Alert if live objects in OU exceed agreed ceiling (capacity + abuse) |
| Create latency (p95) | LDAP create+modify path within agreed budget (tune with AD team) |
| AD error budget | Circuit-break minting when DC bind/modify failure rate exceeds threshold |

